   "prompt": "<p>In the following exercises, suppose that $\\nabla \\cdot \\textbf{F}=0$ and $\\nabla \\cdot \\textbf{G}=0.$</p><p>Does $\\textbf{F}+\\textbf{G}$ necessarily have zero divergence?</p>",
